{"speciesId":572,"names":{"fr":"Chinchidou","es":"Minccino","en":"Minccino","ja":"チラーミィ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils se saluent en se caressant mutuellement le corps avec la queue, qu’ils gardent toujours immaculée."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They greet one another by rubbing each other with their tails, which are always kept well groomed and clean."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon qui aime la propreté. Chez lui, il enlève sans cesse la poussière en utilisant sa queue comme un plumeau."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils se saluent en s’époussetant les uns les autres avec leur queue qui leur sert de plumeau."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se saludan entre sí frotándose con la cola y limpiándose a conciencia."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お互いの 尻尾で 相手を とことん きれいに してあげるのが チラーミィ同士の あいさつ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon qui aime la propreté. Chez lui, il enlève sans cesse la poussière en utilisant sa queue comme un plumeau."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le encanta la limpieza. Usa su cola a modo de escoba y se pasa el día barre que te barre."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"These Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"きれい好きな 性格の ポケモン。 尻尾を ほうきがわりに いつも 住処の ほこりを 払っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ils se saluent en s’époussetant les uns les autres avec leur queue qui leur sert de plumeau."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se saludan entre sí frotándose con la cola y limpiándose a conciencia."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"お互いの 尻尾で 相手を とことん きれいに してあげるのが チラーミィ同士の あいさつ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon qui aime la propreté. Chez lui, il enlève sans cesse la poussière en utilisant sa queue comme un plumeau."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le encanta la limpieza. Usa su cola a modo de escoba y se pasa el día barre que te barre."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"These Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"きれい好きな 性格の ポケモン。 尻尾を ほうきがわりに いつも 住処の ほこりを 払っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce maniaque de la propreté ne supporte pas la moindre saleté. Il utilise sa queue comme une serpillière pour tout nettoyer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon es extremadamente pulcro y no puede ver ni una mota de suciedad o la limpiará usando su cola como si fuera una mopa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A clean freak that will not allow even the slightest mess, it uses its tail like a mop to thoroughly clean any and all filth."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"潔癖症で 少しの 汚れも 許せない。 シッポを モップにして 徹底的に 汚れを 落とす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il lui faut bien une journée entière pour laver sa queue après s’en être servi pour faire le ménage dans son nid et épousseter son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Tras usar la cola para limpiar su madriguera o su propio cuerpo, se pasa un día entero lavándosela con agua de manantial."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When its tail has gotten dirty from self-cleaning or from cleaning its nest, Minccino spends a whole day washing its tail in clean spring water."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"自分の 身体や 巣の 掃除で 汚れた シッポは 綺麗な 湧き水で １日 かけて 洗う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il époussette les saletés avec sa queue. Il est d’une aide précieuse pour faire le ménage, mais il est très tatillon sur la propreté."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Usa la cola para barrer la basurilla. Su extrema pulcritud es tanto una ayuda en la limpieza del hogar como un incordio."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The way it brushes away grime with its tail can be helpful when cleaning. But its focus on spotlessness can make cleaning more of a hassle."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"しっぽで 汚れを 払い落す。 掃除を するときに 助かるが 潔癖症 なので 大変。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Chinchidou se saluent en se frottant la queue. Celui qui a la plus volumineuse en tire une certaine fierté."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se saludan entre sí frotándose la cola. Cuanto más voluminosa es, más orgullosos se muestran."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They pet each other with their tails as a form of greeting. Of the two, the one whose tail is fluffier is a bit more boastful."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"しっぽで なであって 挨拶。 しっぽの 毛が 大きな ほうが 少し 威張っているぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":572,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[11,"level-up",37],[14,"level-up",37],[15,"level-up",37],[16,"level-up",37],[17,"level-up",37],[18,"level-up",37],[20,"level-up",40],[25,"level-up",40]]},{"name":